{{also|Wenn}}
==German==

===Etymology===
Like {{m|de|wann}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*hwannē||at what time, when}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*kʷo-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*kʷi-||interrogative base}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/vɛn/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-wenn.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-wenn.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Conjunction===
{{head|de|conjunction}}

# {{lb|de|subordinating}} [[when]]
#: {{ux|de|Was tun '''wenn''' ich weiß]] nicht, ob sie mich liebt]|translation=What (to do) '''if''' I don't know if she loves me?}}
# {{lb|de|subordinating}} [[if]] {{qualifier|on the condition that}}
====Usage notes====
If a conditional sentence is composed by a passive voice, ''wenn'' is omitted.
#: {{ux|de|Wird das nicht gemacht, müsste die Nutzung beschränkt werden.|translation=(If) that is not done, then the uses must be limited.}}

===See also===
* {{l|de|wann}}

